    Hook_Stats --> UI_Header
    Hook_Refs --> UI_Marketplace
    Hook_Forecast --> UI_ForecastCard
    Comp_LegalCard --> UI_LegalCard
    Comp_HXCard --> UI_HXCard
    Comp_Docs --> UI_Vault
    Comp_Chat --> UI_ChatNotif
    Comp_Notif --> UI_ChatNotif
    P5_Cross --> UI_Crossroads

